session.assistantText:
Verified the pieces: the file is a real MP4 (`ftypmp42`, with `moov`), and the host exposes it at `/api/file?path=…` — the same origin the GUI is served from, gated by the browser's existing session cookie (my raw requests without that cookie get `401 unauthorized`, which confirms the route exists and is cookie-gated). The card renderer whitelists a native `video` component with `src`/`controls`.

```schemaJson
{
  "componentName": "Page",
  "state": {},
  "methods": {},
  "children": [
    {
      "componentName": "TinyCard",
      "children": [
        {
          "componentName": "h3",
          "children": "assets/sample.mp4"
        },
        {
          "componentName": "video",
          "props": {
            "src": "/api/file?path=%2Fdsh%2Fworkspace%2Finline-video-playback%2Fassets%2Fsample.mp4",
            "controls": true,
            "width": "100%",
            "preload": "metadata",
            "playsinline": true
          }
        },
        {
          "componentName": "Text",
          "props": {
            "style": "display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;",
            "text": "直接由工作区文件服务 /api/file 流式返回，无下载链接"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

点上面播放器即可播放（我这边无法代你点，但路由与 MIME 已确认：响应头由 `mime.lookup` 给出 `video/mp4`）。如果播放器区域空白或报错，告诉我现象，我再排查（例如换成 `preload="auto"` 或先经 `/api/file` 做 HEAD 校验）。
